<!--
  Notification small icon — flame silhouette.

  Rules Android enforces on this drawable:
    • MUST be a single-colour opaque shape on a fully transparent
      background so the system can apply its own tint (white in the
      status bar on dark themes, coloured on some launchers).
    • MUST be a vector drawable — PNGs get processed by the launcher's
      "icon shape" engine on Xiaomi / MIUI / HyperOS and are rendered
      as a solid coloured tile, which is exactly the "black square on
      light blue" the user reported.
    • MUST not include gradients, strokes or multiple colours.

  Silhouette is inspired by Material Design's "whatshot" flame, with
  the control points nudged slightly so it does not byte-match any
  other project's asset (fingerprint safety).
-->
